id: legendary-evolved-unstoppable-legend
name: Unstoppable Legend
order: 2
slot: legendary
description: >
  You are nearly impossible to kill, and even harder to hold at bay.
text: >
  Unstoppable Legend: You are nearly impossible to kill, and even harder to hold at bay.
  (1)-[Passive]: While in a Transformation with the Super Saiyan Form Aspect, increase your Wound Rolls and Soak Value by 1(T).
  (2)-[Triggered]: Upon making a Stress Test to enter or remain in a Transformation with the Super Saiyan Form Aspect, you may (after seeing the result) reduce your Life Points by 1/10th of your Maximum Life Points to increase the Dice Score of that Stress Test by 2.
  (3)-[Triggered, 1/Encounter]: Upon entering a Transformation with the Super Saiyan Form Aspect, gain a stack of Battle Born. You must apply this stack of Battle Born to your Wound Rolls.

---

# (1)(2) In a Transformation with the Super Saiyan Form Aspect: the table's.

# (3) Entering one, once an Encounter: a stack of Battle Born on the Wound Rolls.
[triggered/transform, 1/encounter, effect 3]
battlebornwound.stacks += 1;
